00:36:21.060 --> 00:36:22.780
AMY BANZAERT: No,
so just to clarify.

00:36:22.780 --> 00:36:24.480
So last year we did
give out journals,

00:36:24.480 --> 00:36:26.967
and a lot of the D-Lab
trips gave them out

00:36:26.967 --> 00:36:28.800
