00:38:06.540 --> 00:38:11.960
GUEST SPEAKER: Portable--
yeah, it's, like, super thin.

00:38:11.960 --> 00:38:13.290
GUEST SPEAKER: OK.

00:38:13.290 --> 00:38:14.730
AMY BANZAERT: There are
flexible solar cells out there.

00:38:14.730 --> 00:38:15.300
GUEST SPEAKER: I
thought about that,

00:38:15.300 --> 00:38:16.800
and I thought there was a
