00:39:46.720 --> 00:39:48.280
to worry about lack of roofs.

00:39:48.280 --> 00:39:48.860
[CHUCKLES]

00:39:48.860 --> 00:39:49.420
GUEST SPEAKER: You
will find what?

00:39:49.420 --> 00:39:50.380
AMY BANZAERT: You
mentioned you weren't sure

00:39:50.380 --> 00:39:52.930
if there would be roofs,
and people do have--

00:39:52.930 --> 00:39:53.830
GUEST SPEAKER: Roofs.

00:39:53.830 --> 00:39:54.850
GUEST SPEAKER: Roofs.

00:39:54.850 --> 00:39:55.120
OK.

00:39:55.120 --> 00:39:56.703
AMY BANZAERT: Yeah,
they do have them.

00:39:56.703 --> 00:39:57.430
